# Diffusion Compiler Codex routing

Current loader policy (user request, 2026-09-06): **ASM fastload is OFF by
default until fixed and re-admitted**. The prior mapped/direct path is default;
only exact `DIF_FASTLOAD=1` opts in. Streamed/prefetch flags alone cannot enable
it. Preserve bounded staging, shared weight lifetime and rotary fixes. Earlier
"default ASM" benchmark descriptions are historical, not current policy.

Read the applicable skill before editing:

- Architecture or ownership boundary: `$diffusion-architecture`
